Provenance: this package is the EODHD provider extension `openbb-eodhd` from
bdobb-dev/openbb-docker (directory `openbb-eodhd/`), base v9.6.3 (99864f2) with
its fixes through v9.6.6 (68afaa7): commits 99864f2, bbd67cd, 9068e36, 73d0c92,
498d317, eb73012, 564e5ee, cd0aaeb. Original author: Art Cashin (artcashin),
with Claude co-author trailers. Renamed openbq-eodhd (module openbq_eodhd) for
Adventures-OpenBQ; the OpenBB provider name `eodhd`, its core extension `eodhd`
(obb.eodhd.*, /api/v1/eodhd) and the widget ids `eodhd_*_eodhd_obb` are unchanged.

This package includes a vendored copy of the official EODHD Python library
(EODHD-APIs-Python-Financial-Library), Copyright (c) 2021 Michael Whittle,
licensed under the MIT License (see openbq_eodhd/_vendor/eodhd/LICENSE).
Source: https://github.com/EodHistoricalData/EODHD-APIs-Python-Financial-Library
at commit f98e69d797140ca03f16fa7451046d84aab9643e. Only apiclient.py,
errors.py and APIs/ are included; absolute `eodhd.` imports were rewritten to
`openbq_eodhd._vendor.eodhd.` and the package __init__ was trimmed to the REST
client and its error types. No other changes.
